# The three values every server sample reads, under the names the CLI and the docs use. Copy this file to
# express-server/.env or worker-server/.env, and fill it in. Never commit the copy. Wrangler reads .env when there is
# no .dev.vars, and the page samples' dev server refuses to serve a file named .env, where it would serve .dev.vars.
#
# The key is the contents of your AuthKey_XXXXXXXXXX.p8, on one line with each line break written as \n.
APPLE_MUSIC_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\nMIGT...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----"
APPLE_MUSIC_TEAM_ID="ABCDE12345"
APPLE_MUSIC_KEY_ID="ABC123DEFG"

# The page the developer token is bound to. The default is the Vite samples' address.
# PAGE_ORIGIN="http://localhost:2728"
